OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant protest at Dover amid
OL,4,Aface mask ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-immigration protesters have
OL,7,Fgathered in Dover amid police
OL,8,Frestrictions and warnings against the
OL,9,Fuse of face coverings.
OL,11,FEarlier, police vehicles lined the
OL,12,Fstreets outside Dover Priory Station,
OL,13,Fwhich was the starting point of the
OL,14,Fmarch.
OL,16,FKent Police said these "robust"
OL,17,Fpreparations were aimed at keeping
OL,18,Fdisruption to a minimum, after a
OL,19,Fprotest last month caused significant
OL,20,Fdelays at the port.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
