OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant protest at Dover amid
OL,4,Aface mask ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the force said no
OL,7,Farrests had been made on Saturday, and
OL,8,Festimated that about 100 anti-migrant
OL,9,Fprotesters had turned out.
